Package: lats
Architecture: loong64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: System-mode x86 architecture emulator for LoongArch
 LATS (LoongArch Architecture Translator System) is a high-performance
 system-mode binary translator for the LoongArch architecture. It can run
 64-bit x86 operating systems on LoongArch hosts, and further supports
 32-bit and 64-bit x86 applications within the guest.
 .
 It is based on QEMU 8.1.5 with deep optimizations for the LoongArch
 architecture (LATX translation engine, HAMT, RAS and other optimizations).
